            "text": "Pet food nutritional values are determined by a combination of laboratory analysis and feeding trials.",
            "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
            "id": "1",
            "text": "Feeding trials involve feeding the pet food to animals and monitoring their health and well-being.",
            "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
            "id": "2",
            "text": "Pet food companies, including Pedigree, conduct feeding trials to ensure the quality of their products.",
            "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
            "id": "3",
            "text": "High-quality pet food brands include hill's science diet, royal canin, orijen, acana, blue buffalo, wellness, and taste of the wild.",
            "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
            "id": "4",
            "text": "Consultation with a veterinarian is recommended to determine the specific nutritional needs of the pet.",
            "event": "ADD"
        }
    ]
}

